Networking & data|doggo|Query DNS records from the terminal|doggo example.com
Networking & data|gping|Ping hosts with a live terminal graph|gping example.com
Networking & data|jaq|Filter and transform JSON with a jq-compatible command|jaq '.items[]' data.json
